//RS 
//RS fn run() {}
//RS "#;
//RS     assert_eq!(error_codes(method_escape), ["E1110", "E0403"]);
//RS }
//RS 
//RS /// D-CONC-GROUP1=A: a group is a borrow of its scope, so it may be named in
//RS /// every direct parameter position — a method's parameter list exactly like a
//RS /// free function's. The storage ban alone carries the structural guarantee, so
//RS /// a spawn through the method's parameter group still owns its captures.
//RS ///
//RS /// `assert_group_close_success` covers the native execution tiers: interpreter,
//RS /// resident JIT, default `jet run`, and AOT. The separate comptime, REPL, and
